Package: nextgenCrossDesign
Type: Package
Title: Next Generation Cross Prediction and Mate Allocation
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sikiru", "Atanda", email = "pulsesmartlab@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Sikiru Atanda [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Sikiru Atanda <pulsesmartlab@gmail.com>
Description: Breeding-program backend for genomic cross prediction, mate
    allocation, multi-trait selection, calibration, external baseline
    comparison, and crop/ploidy validation workflows. The package provides
    diploid DH/RIL scoring and allocation as the primary validated path, native
    var_complex, SimpleMating-, and AlphaMate-style components without hard
    dependencies on those tools, optional exact external comparison wrappers,
    and explicit experimental modules for
    autotetraploid and allopolyploid model families.
